==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|is|afhverju}} (''[[abbreviation|abbr.]]'')
* {{l|is|akkuru}} (''slang'')

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|af||of}} and {{m|is|hverju}} the dative of {{m|is|hvað||what}}.

===Adverb===
'''[[af]] [[hver]]ju'''

# [[why]]?{{jump|is|why|s}}
#: ''Mamma, '''af hverju''' er himininn blár?''
#:: Mommy, '''why''' is the sky blue?
#: '''''Af hverju''' viltu fara til Spánar?'' — ''[[af hverju ekki|'''Af hverju''' ekki]]?''
#:: '''Why''' do you want to go to Spain? — [[why not|'''Why''' not]]?
#: '''''Af hverju''' mætirðu ekki í veisluna?''
#:: '''Why''' won't you go to the party?

====Synonyms====
* {{jump|s|is|why}} [[hvers vegna]], [[hví]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|af hverju ekki}}?
* {{l|is|sitt af hverju}} (a bit of [[everything]], this and that)
* {{l|is|sitt af hverju tagi}} (of different kinds)

